  "post_content": "<p>Unos 300 alumnos de sexto de Primaria de todos los colegios p&uacute;blicos y concertados de Onda van a descubrir un a&ntilde;o m&aacute;s los secretos de la arquitectura cer&aacute;mica gracias a la actividad &#39;Sotabalcons&#39;, que&nbsp;el mi&eacute;rcoles 10 de abril&nbsp;estrenaron los alumnos de Miralcamp (en las dos fotos grandes) y que en los pr&oacute;ximos d&iacute;as ir&aacute;n acometiendo todos los centros de Onda, seg&uacute;n destaca una nota del Departamento de comunicaci&oacute;n del ayuntamiento, publicada en la web onda.es.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sotabalcons2013/img_4734.jpg\" alt=\"img_4734\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sotabalcons2013/img_4735.jpg\" alt=\"img_4735\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sotabalcons2013/img_4736.jpg\" alt=\"img_4736\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sotabalcons2013/img_4737.jpg\" alt=\"img_4737\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sotabalcons2013/img_4738.jpg\" alt=\"img_4738\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sotabalcons2013/img_4739.jpg\" alt=\"img_4739\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sotabalcons2013/img_4740.jpg\" alt=\"img_4740\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sotabalcons2013/img_4741.jpg\" alt=\"img_4741\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sotabalcons2013/img_4742.jpg\" alt=\"img_4742\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:a